    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is an unconventional post-apocalyptic survival sandbox game. Players will abandon endless combat and instead immerse themselves in a gritty, authentic apocalypse survival experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through a first-person perspective, players will gather resources, craft tools, construct fortified bases, and explore surrounding areas to scavenge anything that aids survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>Upcoming Features &amp; Gameplay:\u200b</strong>\u200b</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>Faction Diplomacy &amp; Conflict:\u200b</strong>\u200b Negotiate with factions through bartering and alliances, or rally others to oppose them. The world\u2019s political landscape will dynamically shift based on player decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>Survivor Rescue &amp; Colony Building:\u200b</strong>\u200b Rescue survivors scattered across the wasteland and establish thriving settlements for them. As trust grows, survivors may join your crew, bolstering your forces to dominate the wasteland.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is an unconventional post-apocalyptic survival sandbox game. Players will abandon endless combat and instead immerse themselves in a gritty, authentic apocalypse survival experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through a first-person perspective, players will gather resources, craft tools, construct fortified bases, and explore surrounding areas to scavenge anything that aids survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>Upcoming Features &amp; Gameplay:\u200b</strong>\u200b</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>Faction Diplomacy &amp; Conflict:\u200b</strong>\u200b Negotiate with factions through bartering and alliances, or rally others to oppose them. The world\u2019s political landscape will dynamically shift based on player decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>Survivor Rescue &amp; Colony Building:\u200b</strong>\u200b Rescue survivors scattered across the wasteland and establish thriving settlements for them. As trust grows, survivors may join your crew, bolstering your forces to dominate the wasteland.</p></li></ul>",
